Package: libbinutils-2.41-compat
Section: libs
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Breaks: libbinutils (<< 2.42~),
        libsframe1 (<< 2.42~)
Replaces: libbinutils (<< 2.42~),
          libsframe1 (<< 2.42~)
Description: GNU binutils 2.41 private runtime libraries (compatibility)
 This package provides the versioned private shared libraries from GNU
 binutils 2.41:
 .
  - libopcodes-2.41-system.so
  - libbfd-2.41-system.so
  - libsframe.so.1
 .
 They are required at run time by binaries that were linked against the
 binutils 2.41 private libraries, such as the prebuilt objtool shipped in
 some kernel headers packages.  The libraries keep the full upstream
 version in their SONAMEs (the Debian "-system" suffix), so they can be
 installed alongside the private libraries from binutils 2.42 and later,
 including binutils 2.47's libopcodes-2.47-system.so,
 libbfd-2.47-system.so and libsframe.so.3, without file or symbol
 conflicts.
 .
 This package does not provide the as, ld, objdump or other binutils
 programs, nor any development headers or unversioned linker names.
